\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">View All Projects</a><a href=\"/request-estimated\" class=\"button button-styles secundary w-button\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-embed w-script\"><!-- Flowbase Booster [Before After Slider] -->\n</div></section><section class=\"mm-proc\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Custom Pool Build <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our pool builders guide your project from 3D design to final installation, delivering code-compliant custom pools across North &amp; South Florida.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Request a Design-Build Project Evaluation</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-065/custom-pool-construction-backyard-lot-before-excavation.avif\" alt=\"Backyard lot behind a new farmhouse with materials staged on the sand before excavation, custom pool construction in Florida\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Site Assessment &amp; Structural Evaluation\"></div></figure><ol class=\"mm-pasos\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-065/custom-pool-construction-backyard-lot-before-excavation.avif\" alt=\"Backyard lot behind a new farmhouse with materials staged on the sand before excavation, custom pool construction in Florida\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Site Assessment &amp; Structural Evaluation</h3><p>Comprehensive evaluation of lot configuration, soil stability, and hydrostatic pressure zones using 3D surveying technology. We assess setback requirements per Florida Building Code Chapter 45, HOA restrictions, and geotechnical conditions to determine engineering specifications.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-065/custom-pool-and-spa-layout-painted-on-site-aerial.avif\" alt=\"Top-down drone view of the approved pool and spa layout painted on the sand next to the house, new pool build in Florida\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:60% 60%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Design Consultation &amp; 3D Rendering</h3><p>Custom design consultation creating detailed 3D architectural renderings showing pool shape, depth variations, spa integration, and surrounding deck configurations. Our licensed designers present multiple options for approval before construction begins.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-065/custom-pool-steel-rebar-and-drains-before-gunite.avif\" alt=\"Steel rebar cage tied over wood forms with main drains and plumbing ready for inspection, custom pool builders in Florida\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Permits &amp; Regulatory Compliance</h3><p>Comprehensive permit acquisition including Notice of Commencement (NOC), VGB compliance certification, and ARB approvals if applicable. We manage all interactions with county building departments and HOA review boards to ensure seamless approval.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-065/custom-pool-gunite-shell-being-sprayed-aerial.avif\" alt=\"Top-down view of a crew spraying the gunite shell beside the spa form, custom pool construction in Florida\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:40% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Construction &amp; Installation</h3><p>Full construction execution including gunite shell application with pneumatic concrete, hydrostatic pressure management systems, bond coat application, plaster finishes, equipment installation, and final inspections with CPC licensing.</p></li></ol></div></section>";
const T6 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Pool Construction <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about custom pool construction in Florida? Our licensed pool builders answer the most common questions from Florida homeowners below.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do custom pool installations increase home value in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>It can, but no honest builder can promise a percentage: the effect depends on the neighborhood, the home and the quality of the build. What we control is what buyers, inspectors and appraisers check: a permitted pool built under our Florida pool contractor licenses (CPC1461119 and CPC1460562), with its inspections passed and its final approval on file.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>What pool and spa design options are available?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>We offer fully custom pool designs with flexible shapes, depths, and integrated features including attached spas, tanning ledges, waterfalls, LED lighting systems, and swim-up bars. Every design begins with a full 3D architectural rendering so you can visualize the finished pool before construction begins.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are custom pools in Florida low-maintenance?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Modern pool systems equipped with variable-speed pumps, saltwater generators, and automated controllers significantly reduce the time and cost of pool ownership in Florida. Smart filtration and chemical automation handle routine tasks, so homeowners spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying their custom pool year-round.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How long does pool construction take in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>It depends on the design, the permit review and the weather, so we give you a schedule for your own project instead of a generic number. The sequence is always the same: design and engineering, permit review, excavation, steel and gunite, plumbing and electrical, tile, coping and deck, interior finish, and start-up, with the county or city inspections between stages. We coordinate every one of them.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can I finance a custom pool project in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. We connect Florida homeowners with lending partners, and the order matters: you get your design and a fixed project price in writing first, and only then review how to pay for it. Approval and terms come from the lender.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How much does a custom pool cost in North Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>There is no single number: a custom pool is priced from its own design, size, finishes and site conditions. Our estimator walks you through the choices that move the price, and you get a fixed project price in writing before you commit.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Who pulls the permits for a pool in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>We do. Permitting and code compliance are part of the build: we prepare the submittal, pull the permits and coordinate the county inspections through to final start-up.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>What is included in a custom pool project?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Design and 3D rendering, engineering, permitting, excavation, the gunite shell, plumbing and circulation, electrical and equipment, interior finish, tile and coping, the deck, and final start-up.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-faq-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/pool-construction-4/custom-pool-spa-builders-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Rectangular pool with a raised glass-tile spa, stepping stones in the lawn and a covered patio, custom pool in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"#estimate\">Request a Design-Build Project Evaluation</a><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"testimonial-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"74852c7c-aeb3-35a7-5cf1-44f4ce6ecae5\" class=\"header-reviews\"><div class=\"label\">TESTIMONIALS</div><h2 class=\"white\">What Our Clients Say About Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><p>Hear from Florida clients who love the custom pools and spas built by our licensed team for relaxation, year-round entertaining, and lasting home value.</p></div>";
